    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38223" root="مجد" body-key="m">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مجّدهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمْجِيدٌ</span>, <i>He attributed,</i> or
<i>ascribed to him,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْد</span> [or <i>glory, honour, dignity,</i>
or <i>nobility, &amp;c.; he glorified him; honoured
him; &amp;c.</i>]; (S, L;) <i>he magnified him, and
praised him;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امجدهُ</span></b> . (L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مجّدهُ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امجدهُ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (God) <i>honoured his</i> (a
man's) <i>deeds,</i> or <i>actions:</i> or <i>may He honour his
deeds,</i> or <i>actions!</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مجّدهُ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امجدهُ</span></b> 
<i>He made it</i> (a gift) <i>large,</i> or <i>abundant.</i> (L, K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See 4.

